      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.66.148</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Congelar várias pistas não derruba mais o Dreams. Bypass sem travar: liga/desliga com micro-fade de 5 ms e true bypass. Device On/Off automatizável em blocos. Knob Wet (laranja) em todo efeito, automatizável na Main Lane.</li></ul>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/kizzydark/dreams-releases/releases/download/v0.66.148/Dreams-0.66.148.zip" length="38191051" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="k4hwAiWYlBO9id+jAdZYTJ9hYk7+5YdqTaOC5Fj8/tyQFmeH3u8skIPTbE1EnzfBRErQumACsd5FQxLs/+qAAg=="/>
